00:58:25.880 --> 00:58:32.760
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who wishes to take a moment to send this message to his masters back in the Soviet Union.

00:58:32.760 --> 00:58:38.840
<v Morpheus>Bravo, Delta, Two, Niner, One, Charlie, Foxtrot.

00:58:38.840 --> 00:58:55.300
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:58:55.300 --> 00:59:00.300
